WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Okay!

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:11.367
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:11.967
A.

00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:12.600
Neptune,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.233
B.

00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:13.867
Hockey,

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:14.500
C.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.100
Soccer,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.367
or D.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:17.000
Boxing?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.233
Five seconds!

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:25.233
TIME'S UP!

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.433
The answer is...

00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:27.933
A,

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:28.467
neptune!

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:28.967
Hockey,

00:00:28.967 --> 00:00:29.467
soccer,

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:32.033
and boxing are all sports.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.067
Neptune is a planet,

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.633
so it does not belong.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.800
Here's one,

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.333
a picture puzzle!

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.900
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.400
A.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.967
An empty teardrop,

00:00:44.967 --> 00:00:45.467
B.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:47.000
An empty cross,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.500
C.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.067
An empty square,

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:50.067
or D.

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:51.633
A filled arrow?

00:00:51.633 --> 00:00:52.633
Five seconds!

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.633
TIME'S UP!

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.400
The answer is...

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:01.800
D,

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.900
a filled arrow!

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.133
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:07.367
filled in but stays the same

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:07.733
shape,

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.967
so the empty arrow becomes a

00:01:09.967 --> 00:01:10.700
filled arrow.

00:01:11.867 --> 00:01:13.233
Here's one,

00:01:13.233 --> 00:01:15.267
a number series!

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:15.933
Seven,

00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:16.633
eleven,

00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:17.300
seventeen,

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.000
twenty-five,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.667
thirty-five,

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.033
and then...

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.067
what comes next?

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:22.733
A.

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:23.433
Forty-six,

00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:24.100
B.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:24.800
Forty-seven,

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.467
C.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.133
Forty-four,

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:27.500
or D.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.200
Forty-two?

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.533
Five seconds!

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:36.533
TIME'S UP!

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.567
The answer is...

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:39.033
B,

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:39.500
forty-seven!

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.267
The gaps grow by the same

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.633
amount each step,

00:01:43.633 --> 00:01:46.400
so the next number is forty-seven.

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:47.967
So,

00:01:47.967 --> 00:01:50.000
are you smart or fart?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.433
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:53.633
find your rank!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.133
So,

00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:56.533
how did you do?

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:57.900
Comment your score below,

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.267
and follow for more!
